        "jsCode": "// Loop over input items and add a new field called 'myNewField' to the JSON of each one\nconst urls = [\n  $json.img1,\n  $json.img2,\n  $json.img3,\n  $json.img4\n].filter(Boolean);\n\n// jadikan 1 URL = 1 item\nreturn urls.map((url, index) => ({\n  json: {\n    url,\n    index: index + 1\n  }\n}));"
